| `src/store/profiles.js` | Modify | `actions.saveProfile` | Reloads with `force: true` so saved changes appear immediately. |
| `src/store/profiles.js` | Modify | `actions.deleteProfile` | Reloads with `force: true` so deleted profiles disappear immediately. |

